/*
 * Implements semantic validation for `def` declarations.
 *
 * This module handles:
 *   - validation of value definitions(`def x = Value`),
 *   - validation of type definitions(`def T: Type`),
 *   - detection of forward-reference cycles,
 *   - construction of generator values for defs,
 *   - error propagation and wrapping for invalid definitions,
 *   - verification of addressability for value definitions.
 *
 * Def validation is performed using a per-definition recursion-depth counter
 * stored in the DefContext. This prevents infinite recursion when defs
 * reference each other cyclically.

 *
 * <hr>
 *
 * @Package: ymirc
 * @Module: ymirc::semantic::validator::symbol::def_
 * @File: ymirc/semantic/validator/symbol/def_.yr
 * @Author(s):
 *   - Emile Cadorel <ecadorel@gmail.com>
 *
 * @Created(YYYY-MM-DD): 2026-05-26
